    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>FOREMAN FRENZY!</i></strong> is a fast-paced frantic arcade platformer inspired by the wildest hits of the '80s and '90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUN, CLIMB, DODGE, and BOUNCE your way through 9 challenging and tense rounds, \u00a0fetch your crew's 5 fallen lunches before time runs out, and <i>whatever you do</i>, STEER CLEAR of the mutant <i>food dudes</i> lurking around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spring\u00a0pads,\u00a0ladders,\u00a0and very tight platforming\u00a0to\u00a0your\u00a0advantage, and\u00a0do\u00a0whatever it takes to make\u00a0sure your\u00a0crew is\u00a0well fed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[This game is\u00a0controlled with\u00a0a\u00a0keyboard,\u00a0but\u00a0feel free\u00a0to use\u00a0applications like\u00a0JoyToKey\u00a0to\u00a0bind\u00a0your\u00a0controller\u00a0inputs into\u00a0keyboard\u00a0presses!]</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>FOREMAN FRENZY!</i></strong> is a fast-paced frantic arcade platformer inspired by the wildest hits of the '80s and '90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUN, CLIMB, DODGE, and BOUNCE your way through 9 challenging and tense rounds, \u00a0fetch your crew's 5 fallen lunches before time runs out, and <i>whatever you do</i>, STEER CLEAR of the mutant <i>food dudes</i> lurking around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spring\u00a0pads,\u00a0ladders,\u00a0and very tight platforming\u00a0to\u00a0your\u00a0advantage, and\u00a0do\u00a0whatever it takes to make\u00a0sure your\u00a0crew is\u00a0well fed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[This game is\u00a0controlled with\u00a0a\u00a0keyboard,\u00a0but\u00a0feel free\u00a0to use\u00a0applications like\u00a0JoyToKey\u00a0to\u00a0bind\u00a0your\u00a0controller\u00a0inputs into\u00a0keyboard\u00a0presses!]</p>",
